From: DotRedstone <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sheng: read ABL boot reason with embedded control DT

The direct Android v4 image uses CONFIG_OF_EMBED. Its control DT does not
contain ABL's /chosen/bootargs, so both the direct-menu charger bypass and
the EFI boot-reason variable miss real charger insertions. Read the saved
previous-bootloader DT for Sheng in this configuration. Apply the same USB
and power-key PON bit test as the Mobile NixOS stage-1 charger detector.

--- a/arch/arm/mach-snapdragon/board.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-snapdragon/board.c
@@ -358,0 +359,19 @@
+	/* The direct Android image embeds U-Boot's DT. ABL bootargs live in
+	 * the separate previous-bootloader DT, not in the control DT.
+	 */
+	if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_OF_EMBED) &&
+	    of_machine_is_compatible("xiaomi,sheng")) {
+		const void *abl_fdt = (void *)get_prev_bl_fdt_addr();
+		int chosen;
+
+		if (abl_fdt && !fdt_check_header(abl_fdt)) {
+			chosen = fdt_path_offset(abl_fdt, "/chosen");
+			if (chosen >= 0) {
+				cmdline = fdt_getprop(abl_fdt, chosen,
+						      "bootargs", NULL);
+				if (cmdline)
+					return cmdline;
+			}
+		}
+	}
+
@@ -412,2 +431,2 @@
-	/* Other PON sources may represent a normal reboot while USB is present. */
-	return (reason & 0xff) == BIT(4);
+	/* Match stage-1: USB_CHG may coexist with other non-key PON bits. */
+	return (reason & BIT(4)) && !(reason & BIT(7));
